# Prettier on commit is disabled.
#
# It ran `prettier --write "src/**/*.ts"` across the WHOLE src tree on every
# commit and rewrote CRLF->LF. Since the repo blobs are CRLF and this is a
# Windows checkout, that left ~108 unstaged files dirty after each commit
# (pure line-ending churn, no real diff), forcing a `git restore -- src/`
# every time. Upstream maintainers don't hit this (LF-native macOS/Linux).
#
# To re-enable, restore the single line below:
#   pnpm run format:fix
#
# To format manually when you want it: `pnpm run format`
